{"sha": "25585b242a881ad04e290afc1ae9c3b0f74bb9bc0f210d2fb14bc9e3e65d09d5", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:quantum-introduction} 章 --- 量子物理导论}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:1}", "$h\\nu$：\\qty{100}{MHz}：$6.6 \\times 10^{-26}$~J $= \\qty{4.1e-7}{eV}$；\\qty{500}{nm}：", "$1240/500 = \\qty{2.5}{eV}$；\\qty{0.10}{nm}：\\qty{12.4}{keV}；\\qty{1}{MeV}：$\\lambda =", "1240/10^6 = \\qty{1.2e-3}{nm} = \\qty{1.2}{pm}$。激光：$1240/633 = \\qty{1.96}{eV} =", "\\qty{3.1e-19}{J}$，因此 $10^{-3}/3.1 \\times 10^{-19} = 3.2 \\times 10^{15}$ 个光子", "每秒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:2}", "$\\lambda_0 = 1240/2.3 = \\qty{540}{nm}$。在 \\qty{400}{nm} 处，$h\\nu = \\qty{3.1}{eV}$：", "$E_{k,\\max} = \\qty{0.8}{eV}$，$V_s = \\qty{0.8}{V}$。光强加倍，", "电流加倍，$V_s$ 保持不变。在 \\qty{600}{nm} 处", "（\\qty{2.07}{eV} $< W$）：无论光强多大，都没有光电子发射。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:3}", "电子：$1.23/\\sqrt{100} = \\qty{0.12}{nm}$；在 \\qty{1}{keV} 时：\\qty{0.039}{nm}。", "中子：$E = \\qty{4.0e-21}{J}$，$p = \\sqrt{2m_nE} = \\qty{3.7e-24}{kg.m/s}$，", "$\\lambda = h/p = \\qty{0.18}{nm}$。小球：$6.6 \\times 10^{-34}/10^{-3} = \\qty{7e-31}{m}$。", "前三者的 $\\lambda$ 与原子间距同数量级，", "均会发生衍射（电子、中子及 X 射线晶体学）；小球则永不发生。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:4}", "$E_1 = h^2/8m_eL^2 = 4.39 \\times 10^{-67}/(8 \\times 9.11 \\times 10^{-31} \\times 10^{-18}) =", "\\qty{6.0e-20}{J} = \\qty{0.38}{eV}$，$E_2 = 4E_1 = \\qty{1.5}{eV}$；光子", "\\qty{1.13}{eV}，$\\lambda = 1240/1.13 = \\qty{1.1}{\\micro m}$（近红外）。质子", "限制在 \\qty{5}{fm} 内：$4.39 \\times 10^{-67}/(8 \\times 1.67 \\times 10^{-27} \\times 25 \\times 10^{-30}) =", "\\qty{1.3e-12}{J} = \\qty{8}{MeV}$ ——核能的量级，", "仅由束缚即可得到。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:5}", "斜率 $(2.05 - 0.40)/(4.0 \\times 10^{14}) = \\qty{4.1e-15}{V.s}$，$h = e \\times 4.1 \\times", "10^{-15} = \\qty{6.6e-34}{J.s}$。$W = h\\nu - eV_s = 2.48 - 0.40 = \\qty{2.1}{eV}$，", "截止波长 $\\lambda_0 = 1240/2.1 = \\qty{600}{nm}$：金属为铯。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:6}", "$\\Delta\\lambda = \\qty{2.43}{pm}$：$\\lambda' = \\qty{12.4}{pm}$。散射前：$1240/0.010 =", "\\qty{124}{keV}$；散射后：$1240/0.0124 = \\qty{100}{keV}$；电子获得", "\\qty{24}{keV}。对于光，$\\Delta\\lambda/\\lambda = 2.4 \\times 10^{-12}/5 \\times 10^{-7} = 5 \\times", "10^{-6}$：1923 年无法测量——X 射线使该偏移成为 $25\\%$ 的效应。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:7}", "$p = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.11 \\times 10^{-31} \\times 5 \\times 10^4 \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19}} =", "\\qty{1.2e-22}{kg.m/s}$，$\\lambda = \\qty{5.5}{pm}$（相对论修正后为", "\\qty{5.4}{pm}）；条纹间距 $\\lambda D/d = 5.5 \\times 10^{-12} \\times 0.35/2 \\times 10^{-6}", "= \\qty{1}{\\micro m}$：肉眼不可见，因此需要放大透镜。十个", "电子：十个点，看似随机分布；$10^5$ 个：出现条纹。每个", "电子只落在一点上；落点的\\emph{概率}遵循", "双缝波动图样——单个电子的波同时通过两条缝。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:8}", "原子：$\\Delta p \\geq \\hbar/2\\Delta x = \\qty{5.3e-25}{kg.m/s}$，$E \\sim \\Delta p^2/2m_e =", "\\qty{1.5e-19}{J} \\approx \\qty{1}{eV}$：量级正确。原子核：$\\Delta p \\geq", "\\qty{1.1e-20}{kg.m/s}$；$\\Delta p^2/2m_e$ 将达到 \\qty{400}{MeV}，远高于", "$m_ec^2$，因此取 $E \\approx \\Delta p\\,c = \\qty{3e-12}{J} = \\qty{20}{MeV}$：原子核内任何力", "都无法束缚如此高能的电子——原子核", "中不含电子（β 电子是在发射时产生的）。颗粒：$\\Delta v \\geq", "\\hbar/2m\\Delta x = 1.05 \\times 10^{-34}/(2 \\times 10^{-9} \\times 10^{-6}) = \\qty{5e-20}{m/s}$：", "可忽略。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:9}", "(a) $m_ev^2/r = e^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2$：$v = \\sqrt{e^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0m_er}$，$E =", "\\tfrac12m_ev^2 - e^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r = -e^2/8\\pi\\varepsilon_0r$。(b) $m_evr = n\\hbar$ 且", "$m_ev^2r = e^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0$：将第一式平方后除以第二式：", "$m_er = n^2\\hbar^2 \\cdot 4\\pi\\varepsilon_0/e^2$，$r_n = n^2a_0$，且 $E_n = -e^2/8\\pi\\varepsilon_0n^2a_0", "= E_1/n^2$，其中 $a_0 = \\qty{52.9}{pm}$，$E_1 = \\qty{-13.6}{eV}$。(c) $v_1 =", "\\hbar/m_ea_0 = \\qty{2.19e6}{m/s}$，$v_1/c = 1/137$。(d) $2 \\to 1$：$\\tfrac34 \\times", "13.6 = \\qty{10.2}{eV}$，\\qty{122}{nm}；$3 \\to 2$：$(\\tfrac14 - \\tfrac19) \\times 13.6 =", "\\qty{1.89}{eV}$，\\qty{656}{nm}。(e) $\\lambda_n = h/m_ev_n = nh/m_ev_1 = 2\\pi na_0$", "（因为 $m_ev_1a_0 = \\hbar$），且 $2\\pi r_n = 2\\pi n^2a_0 = n\\lambda_n$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:10}", "(a) 将 $e^2$ 替换为 $Ze^2$：$a_0 \\to a_0/Z$，$E_1 \\to Z^2E_1$。He$^+$：", "\\qty{54.4}{eV}。U$^{91+}$：$92^2 \\times 13.6 = \\qty{115}{keV}$——但此时 $v_1 = Z\\alpha c", "= 0.67c$：此处非相对论模型仅具指示意义。(b) $a_0/207", "= \\qty{256}{fm}$，$E_1 = 207 \\times 13.6 = \\qty{2.8}{keV}$；赖曼 $\\alpha$ 线：", "\\qty{2.1}{keV}，$\\lambda = \\qty{0.59}{nm}$（X 射线）。μ 子的轨道仅约为", "$300$ 个质子半径：其能级随质子大小可测地移动，", "这正是（2010 年）重新测定质子半径的方法。(c) 两个", "粒子绕其共同质心运动：约化质量 $m_e/2$ 使", "每一能量减半：$E_1 = \\qty{-6.8}{eV}$，赖曼 $\\alpha$ 线位于 \\qty{5.1}{eV}，\\qty{243}{nm}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:11}", "(a) $h^2/8m_e = \\qty{6.02e-38}{J.m^2}$。$R = \\qty{2}{nm}$：$E_e = 6.02 \\times 10^{-38}/", "(0.13 \\times 4 \\times 10^{-18}) = \\qty{0.72}{eV}$，$E_h = \\qty{0.21}{eV}$，总能量 $1.74 +", "0.93 = \\qty{2.67}{eV}$，\\qty{464}{nm}：蓝色。\\qty{3}{nm}：束缚能 $\\times4/9$，", "\\qty{2.15}{eV}，\\qty{577}{nm}：黄色。\\qty{4}{nm}：$\\times1/4$，\\qty{1.97}{eV}，", "\\qty{629}{nm}：红色。(b) \\qty{520}{nm} 对应 \\qty{2.38}{eV}：束缚能 \\qty{0.65}{eV}", "$= 0.93 \\times (2/R)^2$，$R = \\qty{2.4}{nm}$。(c) 无束缚时：仅 $E_g$，", "\\qty{713}{nm}。(d) $\\delta E = -2 \\times 0.1 \\times 0.41 = \\qty{-0.08}{eV}$，占", "\\qty{2.15}{eV} 的 $4\\%$：约 \\qty{20}{nm} 的波长展宽——纯色需要", "单分散的样品批次。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:quantum-introduction:12}", "(a) $E(\\Delta x) = \\hbar^2/8m\\Delta x^2 + \\tfrac12m\\omega^2\\Delta x^2$；导数为零时", "$\\Delta x^2 = \\hbar/2m\\omega$，此时两项均等于 $\\hbar\\omega/4$：$E_{\\min} =", "\\hbar\\omega/2$。(b) $\\tfrac12 \\times 1.055 \\times 10^{-34} \\times 8.3 \\times 10^{14} = \\qty{4.4e-20}{J}", "= \\qty{0.27}{eV}$；$T \\sim \\hbar\\omega/k_B = \\qty{6300}{K}$——在室温下", "振动冻结于其基态。(c) $\\Delta p = \\hbar/2\\Delta x =", "\\qty{1.05e-24}{kg.m/s}$，$E = \\Delta p^2/2m_{\\mathrm{He}} = 1.1 \\times 10^{-48}/1.33 \\times", "10^{-26} = \\qty{8e-23}{J} = \\qty{0.5}{meV}$：约为束缚能的一半——原子无法", "静止到足以结晶的程度；氦在", "绝对零度附近仍保持液态，除非受压（\\qty{25}{bar}）。(d) $E_1 = \\pi^2\\hbar^2/2mL^2$ 与", "$\\hbar^2/2mL^2$ 相比：大十倍，理应如此——该束缚只是", "下界，而盒中态的 $\\Delta x \\approx 0.18L$，而非 $L/2$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}